# Regenerable artefacts. `python model/ta02/run_ta02.py` rebuilds all of them.
# The close-out model is DERIVED from table_guard.imi by run_imi.sh adding exactly
# one constraint -- committing it would let the two drift apart silently, which is
# the whole reason it is generated rather than retyped.
*.bin
*.bin.tmp
*.tck
*.res
table_guard_closeout.imi
table_guard_closeout.imiprop
